[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3186298718","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109557#issuecomment-3186298718","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109557","id":3186298718,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc696w9e","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-14T00:47:47Z","updated_at":"2025-08-14T00:48:34Z","body":"The mesh is flat-shaded, so all faces are actually split from each other (and are not actually connected). Simplification relies on the same mechanism as LOD generation, so it'll only work with smooth-shaded meshes. I don't know if it's possible to make it work with flat-shaded meshes.\n\nIf you use **Shade Smooth** on the object in Blender then export it again, simplification should work.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3186298718/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3186445720","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109557#issuecomment-3186445720","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109557","id":3186445720,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc697U2Y","user":{"login":"DezBoyle","id":41555304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNTU1MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41555304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle","html_url":"https://github.com/DezBoyle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-14T01:56:32Z","updated_at":"2025-08-14T01:56:32Z","body":"@Calinou Oh interesting.  I wasn't aware that LOD generation only works with smooth faces.  I just tested it and it does work as intended with with smooth shading.\n\nDo you have any advice on what I can do instead to generate a simplified mesh?  I was hoping it would work similar to how \"Decompose Convex\" works with auto-generated colliders.\n\nThanks for your time","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3186445720/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3188591669","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109557#issuecomment-3188591669","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109557","id":3188591669,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-Dgw1","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-14T14:07:32Z","updated_at":"2025-08-14T14:07:41Z","body":"> Do you have any advice on what I can do instead to generate a simplified mesh? I was hoping it would work similar to how \"Decompose Convex\" works with auto-generated colliders.\n\nYou could switch your faces to smooth shading, but emulate flat shading with a custom shader (the `flat` [interpolation qualifier](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.html#interpolation-qualifiers) in the shader language will help here).\n\nIt could technically be posible to reuse decomposed convex collision data for an occluder, but it probably won't be accurate enough in most cases to avoid overocclusion issues, unless you use a very high shape count which would make generating the shape very slow (V-HACD is not exactly a fast algorithm). In comparison, meshoptimizer deals with high polycount meshes much faster.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3188591669/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3207541536","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109557#issuecomment-3207541536","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109557","id":3207541536,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_LzMg","user":{"login":"DezBoyle","id":41555304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNTU1MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41555304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle","html_url":"https://github.com/DezBoyle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T18:13:46Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T18:13:46Z","body":"@Calinou \n\nThanks man.  This also had the side effect of also making my LOD actually work haha","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3207541536/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,